#. Tag: title
#: file-formats.docbook:234
#, no-c-format
msgid "Moving Image Formats (Videos)"
msgstr ""

#. Tag: para
#: file-formats.docbook:236
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"Many digital cameras support taking of short movie clips. These clips are "
"usually stored in AVI or MPEG format. &digikam; understands these formats and "
"will generate thumbnails for the movie files. However, &digikam; is not a "
"movie "
"editing application and it does not have any built-in movie viewing or "
"editing "
"capabilities. If you double click on a movie file &digikam; will use your "
"&kde; "
"settings to choose a viewing application to use."
msgstr ""

